  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.29 Multi-Use Decal Plates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.29 Multi-Use Decal Plates. Multi-Use decal plates authorized under RSA 261-B or RSA 261-C shall:\n\n(a) Have up to 5 numerical or alpha characters, none of which shall be preceded solely by zeros;\n\n(b) If a vanity plate as defined in Saf-C 508, have up to 5 characters that otherwise conform to the requirements of Saf-C 513.62(c);\n\n(c) If a veteran plate, shall be issued to a motor vehicle registered pursuant to RSA 261:87-b; and\n\n(d) If a veteran vanity plate, shall have 1 to 5 characters that otherwise conform to the requirements of Saf-C 513.62(c).\n\nSource. #10135, eff 5-23-12; renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.28); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.28)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
